  "bodyHash": "9d0a69586f581ccf",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《雙扇門》是一款極簡風格的模組，讓相同的雙扇門、陷阱門與柵欄門能夠同時開啟。只需點擊任意一扇（木製）門，或按下單個壓力板／按鈕即可觸發。預設情況下，模組還會自動搜尋並開啟其他相連的同類門方塊，最遠可達 10 格範圍。此功能可在設定檔中切換。村民也能開啟雙扇門！<br><br>蹲下時會停用雙扇門功能，僅開啟／關閉單一方塊。<br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>若您希望柵欄門與陷阱門也能「雙開」，請務必在設定檔中啟用相關選項！</strong><br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s RPG 套件包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"運行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableRecursiveOpening</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否啟用遞迴開啟功能。這允許您例如用陷阱門建造一扇巨大的門，只要相連就能同時開啟。'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 設定項決定了該功能搜尋的最大距離。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：10，最小值：1，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用 'enableRecursiveOpening' 時，遞迴函式應搜尋的方塊數量。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableDoors</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，模組將支援雙扇門功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFenceGates</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，模組將支援雙柵欄門功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableTrapdoors</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，模組將支援雙陷阱門功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableModIncompatibilityCheck</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">檢查是否有其他已載入具備雙扇門功能的模組。若發現，會修改其設定檔中的一行程式碼以停用雙扇門。修復因程式碼重複執行而導致門無法開啟的問題。</span><br><br></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"實機展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>支援所有雙扇門組合，還能與其他相連方塊進行遞迴同步開啟！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"332\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>系統會自動遞迴搜尋並開啟任何相連的門類方塊：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>預設情況下，遞迴功能會開啟 10 格內的相連方塊，但可透過 'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 設定進行調整：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>點擊兩扇門中的任意一扇，另一扇也會隨之開啟：</span></strong><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"848\" height=\"428\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用單一按鈕即可開啟鐵門，或搭配任何其他組合。</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/e.webp\" alt=\"gif1\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>支援上下堆疊的陷阱門與柵欄門，可透過點擊、壓力板或按鈕觸發。</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/f.webp\" alt=\"gif2\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>村民也能開啟雙扇門！</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/h.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可自由將本模組用於任何模組整合包，前提是下載來源必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於模組頁面過多，已關閉留言功能以便集中管理。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 專案頁面</a> 回報。感謝支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
